{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>You know the people, that they are set on evil.</b> He says that they are on an evil path, for they said to me to make them a guide in place of my master until his return to me — perhaps he will return — and they gave me the gold, and I cast it into the fire, and out came this calf. For they devised an evil plan concerning it, to bow down to it and to sacrifice to it. And because Aaron did not wish to elaborate on their corruptness, he abbreviated and said, \"And out came this calf\" — that this evil matter came about, which my master sees."], :book :exodus, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T03:20:05.611018814Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}